{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "1444400351a474d0d726d0c3a69b5fd7ccd07f2bd9320585e53b388da3ce48e6", "ja": "これで、私を見てくれるよね？", "zh": "这样一来，就会看着我了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "fafb27cd5d49a1c7e0961c41f4d9c7bf2b95c62cdbc5f4064106d104b48729b6", "ja": "昴の兄達も、西エリアのアイドルユニット、\n『D.O.S.S.』を褒め、荒れる昴。亜美や\nみんなを巻き込み、レッスンルームで作戦\n会議を始める。鍵はきっと新曲にあると\nいう事になり、聞き直してみることに。", "zh": "昴的哥哥们称赞了西区偶像组合\n『D.O.S.S.』，令昴心烦意乱。她拉上亚美和\n大家，在练习室召开了作战会议。\n大家认为关键很可能在于新曲，\n于是决定重新听一遍。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_03_1000_047sub", "source_sha256": "e6bacfdb13fac68bab8b0741d0c7fe509b496a029189346fda89dfc1ec570cc5", "ja": "兄ちゃんの……\nバカーーーーっ！！", "zh": "哥哥他……\n\n大笨蛋——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_03_1001_011ami", "source_sha256": "666860a71d10e2658f13c362076f171eec574088273c2bae8c181c62fd01f8ba", "ja": "わかるよ、昴くん……\n今は思いっきり、叫んじまいな……。", "zh": "我懂的，昴……\n现在就尽情喊出来吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_03_1002_047sub", "source_sha256": "f43388dacb20a992eada03892374322491475eb8f5825c76211dc598eda72c1f", "ja": "よし、もう1回だ！", "zh": "好，再来1次！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_03_1003_p", "source_sha256": "fb9253183ee2a1329217164ebe5bf0df82bcd7850b2c4e9f5001144ee04f25a7", "ja": "もう1回はやめよう、昴。\n劇場内にいる他の人がびっくりしちゃうからな。", "zh": "别再来1次了，昴。\n剧场里的其他人会被吓到的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_03_1004_p", "source_sha256": "5f263ff7e15f07229e36cba8f144ae34cc58003bef7929af3f4385ffa32651b5", "ja": "というか、この流れには既視感があるんだけど……\n今度はどうしたんだ？", "zh": "话说回来，我总觉得这情形似曾相识……\n这次又怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_03_1005_047sub", "source_sha256": "7dc86068ed81e78891edd2f509b793c7736187054a0ac7ce398d14148b1b2912", "ja": "{$P$}、聞いてくれよ！　オレの\n兄ちゃんがさ、京都のアイドルのこと褒めるんだぜ！", "zh": "{$P$}，听我说啊！我哥他啊，居然夸京都的偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_03_1006_047sub", "source_sha256": "1d606def6a507bb3bdd030aae12dc95426d96816d90837f7a821a54f379d89fa", "ja": "スタイルがいいとか、大人っぽいとか！\nなんなんだよー！", "zh": "说什么身材好啊、成熟啊！\n到底是怎么回事嘛——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_03_1007_p", "source_sha256": "0723ddac3a014e9835815ffb39be1de6b63fb843626e316c8b566663dd1f0b8f", "ja": "あちらは十代後半、高校生から大学生が\n主要メンバーのユニットだからな。", "zh": "那边的组合，主要成员可是十几岁后半段、从高中生到大学生这个年龄层的啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_03_1008_p", "source_sha256": "0874903f6f569fda3bd7f2b6a55f11ca686dade79d9347bd86b37110cd38bc55", "ja": "確かにそういう意味では、中学生のこちらより\n最初から大人っぽいだろう。けど……。", "zh": "确实，从这个意义上来说，比起这边的中学生，她们从一开始就更成熟吧。不过……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_03_1009_047sub", "source_sha256": "8e8f1a18a46d8435c2119c3bdd6b18e7d045e8bb49c3da3347c82eaf40a2ed27", "ja": "『確かに』……？　{$P$}は、\nオレと兄ちゃん、どっちの味方なんだよ～！？", "zh": "“确实”……？{$P$}到底是站在我这边，还是站在哥哥那边啊～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_03_1010_011ami", "source_sha256": "6843347ab59e79946613f1e078a54b1eeabc8a8e51405ccbf90a2bd3501a6d36", "ja": "そうだそうだ！\nどっちの味方なんだー！", "zh": "对对！\n你到底是站在哪一边的——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_03_1011_p", "source_sha256": "f09f94fab5c061ea30cb8638b5484dfe7681cd15257a9d02cd6d5cedf6f46d25", "ja": "（ダメだ……ふたりとも、まだ過敏というか、\n理屈が通じるタイミングではなさそうだ）", "zh": "（不行啊……两个人现在似乎都还很敏感，看来还不是讲道理的时候。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_03_1012_011ami", "source_sha256": "320c8c2323abfb7c9621d9ebf64874915a3d8787757f0639b2626c79928c410c", "ja": "こうなったら……やるしかないよ、昴くん！", "zh": "既然这样……只能上了，昴君！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_03_1013_047sub", "source_sha256": "faa08694af35dfb1aa39f86480067b5062ad9a5fa096392f36a522fe65a1b228", "ja": "ああ、そうだな！\nもちろん、オレも付き合うぜ、亜美！", "zh": "啊，是啊！\n当然了，我也奉陪到底，亚美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_03_1014_p", "source_sha256": "22bc803dca215feb2592dddb9bfb8c1bace79efec1273e0e0389f04b3d9e26fd", "ja": "やるって、何を？", "zh": "要做的话，是做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_03_1015_011ami", "source_sha256": "a034a495d1d116ad786de95e52bbcddc09228ce47d409c9c3d2ec0ca04e90aa6", "ja": "兄ちゃんには秘密に決まってるっしょ！\nみんなをレッスンルームに召喚して、特訓だ！", "zh": "当然要瞒着哥哥啦！\n把大家召集到练习室，进行特训！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_03_1016_047sub", "source_sha256": "0e3cef6f04042efb40460728f969fa52f83cb93cf906d25c9ef4ae1afe0f4048", "ja": "おーっ！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_03_1017_p", "source_sha256": "045cff6ae36d08a0d95f6208604749d32138226c3a4d67ffba866d53d2811bdc", "ja": "（秘密の割には、思いっきり叫んでるけど……。\nここは黙って、発散させた方がいいのかな）", "zh": "（明明说是秘密，却喊得这么响……这里还是装作没听见，让她发泄一下比较好吧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_03_1018_032emi", "source_sha256": "2009f465e0339f3d9c3f519a5d1ebc03349b109b74022dd49584900c294c0aee", "ja": "昴さん、亜美さん、着替えてまいりましたが……\n私たちだけで、新曲のお稽古でしょうか？", "zh": "昴小姐、亚美小姐，我换好衣服过来了……\n就我们几个人练习新曲吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_03_1019_033sih", "source_sha256": "b1de4267179fd9a77839ff8838c57cdcf3f1f59240b55b411c0fcc5cbbd1e612", "ja": "私は自主練するつもりだったから、ちょうどいいけど。\nけど、亜美に呼ばれるとは思わなかった。", "zh": "我本来就打算自主练习，正好合适。\n不过，没想到会被亚美叫来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_03_1020_011ami", "source_sha256": "415e4e307a33a0c4983d855195d12631e76e61f43fbd719a61bf9cc66f36c0c7", "ja": "亜美だって思ってなかったよ！\nイタズラの準備じゃなくて、自主練なんて！", "zh": "我也没想到会是这样呀！\n没想到不是在准备恶作剧，而是在自主练习！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_03_1021_033sih", "source_sha256": "dcc98a7ce40d6fa76633531fda896443276f57b7264263cf3bd221a693415707", "ja": "自覚はあるのね。\n……それじゃ、どうして自主練することになったの？", "zh": "你自己也知道啊。\n……那么，为什么会开始自主练习呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_03_1022_047sub", "source_sha256": "7fcbddfa9e991e36c3ed0ce3ef1e448504dbe1ec899a77d26c1ba8f782b10729", "ja": "聞いてくれよ、志保！　兄ちゃんが……あ、\n{$P$}じゃなくてオレのなんだけど。", "zh": "听我说，志保！我哥他……啊，我说的不是{$P$}，是我亲哥。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_03_1024_033sih", "source_sha256": "39272b1ec506f75e379380eda09882d0f68d7c28cfc2670ca056071455e111a9", "ja": "なるほど。\nそういうわけだったんですね。", "zh": "原来如此。\n所以才会这样啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_03_1025_011ami", "source_sha256": "8182f81fc76467b05cc4265f831c55f4e8a6c4a0e6c8c06bf54dc8233691ac63", "ja": "とにかく！　亜美たちみんなで特訓して、\n兄ちゃんを見返してやろうよ！", "zh": "总之！我们大家一起特训，让哥哥刮目相看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_03_1026_047sub", "source_sha256": "941c18f24b58eb1854506eab30b2a57d43a3ee4602475f778adfb7c7727b55bf", "ja": "そうだそうだ！\n見返してやろうぜー！", "zh": "没错没错！\n一定要让他刮目相看——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_03_1027_011ami", "source_sha256": "b28b6ce2571218cedd676c5f81a23e396e000ef8a7c2d88e415bb0f52793d2aa", "ja": "京都のアイドルに、\nやられっぱなしの亜美じゃないかんね！", "zh": "我可不是会一直被京都的偶像压着打的亚美哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_03_1028_032emi", "source_sha256": "aab5a2a0eb7b8eb4047c9a1b31fac8d210cb257ef97da641a20782c25bd4d9c5", "ja": "さすがです、亜美さん！", "zh": "不愧是亚美小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_03_1029_033sih", "source_sha256": "5ecdc1e13d16f2b676ff12aa236210e143ba62b2b7316915bc73b99c25b42212", "ja": "そうね。……私だって、京都でのパフォーマンスには\n納得してないし。特訓、いいと思う。", "zh": "没错。……我对在京都的表演也并不满意。特训，我觉得不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_03_1030_032emi", "source_sha256": "eea201c4343bf70c0533a2c3cfc5d14a6daac9a8c7592915514fc8d3c6a18fe8", "ja": "私もです。ここは私たち4人で協力して、\n東の大和撫子の底力を見せる時ですね！", "zh": "我也是。现在正是我们这4人齐心协力，展现东方大和抚子真正实力的时候！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_03_1031_047sub", "source_sha256": "2b7bbd1ea9ef189730e8ac0309ddd4a03fdbb4f640f81ae58ace315524e92ad5", "ja": "それじゃ、早速、作戦会議だな！\n相手にあって、オレたちに足りないものってなんだろ？", "zh": "那就赶紧开作战会议吧！\n我们和对手相比，还缺少什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_03_1032_011ami", "source_sha256": "d31d1552ada462fe4744754322d8be036ebf3ced06150ec359402d04b0b02cf9", "ja": "それは……認めたくないが、セクシー……かな……。\n……認めたくないけど！！！", "zh": "那就是……虽然不想承认，但大概是性感……吧……\n……虽然不想承认！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_03_1033_047sub", "source_sha256": "f49261081ab7124d7e2e99418f5ea0c612384b15444ff09a9586e3ac7ab7d53b", "ja": "そうだよな～。{$P$}も\n言ってたけど、オレたち中学生だもんな～。", "zh": "是啊～。{$P$}也这么说过，不过我们毕竟还是初中生嘛～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_03_1034_032emi", "source_sha256": "6566169cb9c370144f4a9f093584e5ec5e7c9b117983c6d60d8b3fcb39374fe3", "ja": "確かに、あの独特のたおやかさには敵いませんが……\nでも、私たちが手も足も出ないほどとも思えません。", "zh": "确实，那种独特的优雅气质我们难以匹敌……\n但我也不觉得我们会毫无还手之力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_03_1035_032emi", "source_sha256": "fe68d2b07a8e7caf9f7b1a7e9431d8ca06ab655720eeaf5abc2cd0856fb40868", "ja": "仕掛け人さまが、私たちにと用意した舞台。\n必ず、勝機はあるはずです！", "zh": "制作人先生为我们准备的舞台。\n一定有获胜的机会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
